{
  "$comment": "Business profile and column mapping for this training dataset. Adapted from config/examples/betterspace-b2c.setup-package.json in the original Business Dashboard template (Google source bindings, validation and confirmation fields removed). The reporting date is not set here: it comes from each day's metadata.json (as_of_date).",
  "id": "betterspace-b2c",
